@RPRX the early one is [this `task.Close(output)` in freedom](https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/676eaf66f8f05d4d558ee7a74b4736623d3feeb9/proxy/freedom/freedom.go#L480), it runs right after responseDone and lands in [TCPWriter.Close](https://github.com/StarProxima/Xray-core/blob/d0a5fe7ab1ba2a79e3e4fb0f4c96813098d70da9/proxy/tun/handler.go#L78), which sends FIN now

the one you remember is [in Handler.Dispatch](https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/676eaf66f8f05d4d558ee7a74b4736623d3feeb9/app/proxyman/outbound/handler.go#L239-L260), both get closed there but only after Process returns, so after uplinkOnly. VMess has the same [task.Close](https://github.com/XTLS/Xray-core/blob/676eaf66f8f05d4d558ee7a74b4736623d3feeb9/proxy/vmess/outbound/outbound.go#L214)

客户端的是 Mux 生成了一对 pipe 给 VLESS 出站，若由 Mux 发起关闭，虽然关不掉 upLinkWriter 了但能关掉 downlinkReader

```go
func (f *DialingWorkerFactory) Create() (*ClientWorker, error) {
	opts := []pipe.Option{pipe.WithSizeLimit(64 * 1024)}
	uplinkReader, upLinkWriter := pipe.New(opts...)
	downlinkReader, downlinkWriter := pipe.New(opts...)

	c, err := NewClientWorker(transport.Link{
		Reader: downlinkReader,
		Writer: upLinkWriter,
	}, f.Strategy)
	if err != nil {
		return nil, err
	}

	go func(p proxy.Outbound, d internet.Dialer, c common.Closable) {
		outbounds := []*session.Outbound{{
			Target: net.TCPDestination(muxCoolAddress, muxCoolPort),
		}}
		ctx := session.ContextWithOutbounds(context.Background(), outbounds)
		ctx, cancel := context.WithCancel(ctx)

		if errP := p.Process(ctx, &transport.Link{Reader: uplinkReader, Writer: downlinkWriter}, d); errP != nil {
			errC := errors.Cause(errP)
			if !(goerrors.Is(errC, io.EOF) || goerrors.Is(errC, io.ErrClosedPipe) || goerrors.Is(errC, context.Canceled)) {
				errors.LogInfoInner(ctx, errP, "failed to handler mux client connection")
			}
		}
		common.Must(c.Close())
		cancel()
	}(f.Proxy, f.Dialer, c.done)

	return c, nil
}
```

~~这里确实依赖 Interrupt 了~~，不过 pipe 都有，~~关掉任一应该都会导致 VLESS 出站的双向 copy 结束，所以同样并不会触发问题~~

Update：后半句可能不对

VLESS 服务端 DispatchLink() 并不会触发问题，`monitor()` 中 `common.Interrupt(m.link.Writer)` 由 `<-w.done.Wait():` 触发且

```go
func (s *Server) DispatchLink(ctx context.Context, dest net.Destination, link *transport.Link) error {
	if dest.Address != muxCoolAddress {
		return s.dispatcher.DispatchLink(ctx, dest, link)
	}
	worker, err := NewServerWorker(ctx, s.dispatcher, link)
	if err != nil {
		return err
	}
	select {
	case <-ctx.Done():
	case <-worker.done.Wait():
	}
	return nil
}
```

这里直接 return 回 VLESS 入站，结束，~~本来如果依赖 `common.Interrupt(link.Writer)` 来结束连接就很抽象，很多都没这接口~~
